# Runtime state of a local dev run. COPY . . would bake it into the image,
# and data_path() migrates legacy root files into an empty /data volume on
# first start — a production container must never inherit a developer's
# reply log, processed sets or onboarding state.
unsubscribe_log.json*
unsubscribe_settings.json
unsubscribe_processed.json
unsubscribe_examined.json
reply_log.json*
reply_settings.json
reply_processed.json
bounce_processed.json*
